WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.701
-Let's get to some news.
Well, guys, President Biden says

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:05.701
that he plans to run
for re-election in 2024.

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:07.100
Meanwhile,
at a rally this weekend,

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.367
President Trump
also hinted at running.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:12.067
It's big news, but all I can
think about is Taylor Swift

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:13.901
being on the show tonight, so...

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:19.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.801
So you know what that means.

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:24.100
It's time for
"The News: Taylor's Version."

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.801
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:28.300
♪♪

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.467
-So, Biden and Trump are both
running for re-election,

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:33.367
and they've got major
"bad blood,"

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:36.200
which everyone knows
"all too well."

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.934
Of course, Trump has quite
the "reputation."

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.667
Every other day, he's like,
"I did something bad,"

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.133
and Biden has to be like,

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.767
"This is why we can't have
nice things,"

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:48.000
which is why this could be
the most dramatic election

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.133
ever -- more --
Importantly --

00:00:51.133 --> 00:00:54.133
"Evermore" importantly,
they both need running mates.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:56.901
Biden is looking at Kamala like,
"You belong with me,"

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:59.100
while Trump is looking
at Mike Pence like,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.501
"We are never ever
getting back together."

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:05.901
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.501
Like, ever.

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.567
Pence is actually considering
a run of his own,

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:11.634
but everyone is like,
"I forgot that you existed."

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:12.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:15.434
"Long story short,"
everyone is tired of politics.

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:17.601
But, hey,
"you need to calm down,"

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.868
"shake it off,"
and get "ready for it,"

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.267
because "'tis the damn season."
So --

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:27.667
Go get your voting "card again,"

00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:29.067
head to the polls --

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:30.767
Yeah, that was a stretch,
that one.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:33.234
Head to the polls and fill in
every "blank space."

00:01:33.234 --> 00:01:35.567
It doesn't matter
if you're blue or "red"

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:37.267
or even a "lavender haze."

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:40.067
You've got to let your voice
be heard,

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:43.534
both in 2024 and during
the midterms in "'22."

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.901
This has been
"The News: Taylor's Version."

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:47.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:48.801
♪♪

